        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2206, #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 6 inch Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Empire Arch Flush Pull made out of solid brass and is available in a wide array of finish color options. The #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 6 inch Flush Pull has a transitional look that makes it ideal for almost any home remodel. The arch shape is both stylish and classic for a timelessness. The Emtek 2206 Pocket Door Flush Pull is mortised into the face of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2206-specifications.gif?v=1704354735 \"width=\"405\" height=\"297\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 2206 Flush Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/small-empire-arch-flush-pull-emtek-2205\"><b>Small Empire Arch Flush Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek 2206 Pocket Door Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 5-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish brad nails.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/specials/pdf/emtek/EMT-2206-Specifications.pdf\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 2206 Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
