                "title": "Large Empire Arch Flush Pull",
                "description": "The Large Empire Arch Flush Pull made out of solid brass and is available in a wide array of finish color options. The #8 Brass 1-7/8 inch x 6 inch Flush Pull has a transitional look that makes it ideal for almost any home remodel. The arch shape is both stylish and classic for a timelessness. The Emtek 2206 Pocket Door Flush Pull is mortised into the face of the door.",
